  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MNA IDF Benchmarking Arab Education Performance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support ALECSO establish regional education observatory  To provide technical assistance and capacity building This project aims to strengthen the capacity of the Arab League Educational and Cultural Organization (ALECSO) to monitor and benchmark the performance of education systems in its member states (22 Arab Countries) and to inform policy discussions throughout the region.  In particular, ALECSO will: (i) create a repository of key education indicators, available to a large public through a web-based interactive tool; (ii) build the capacity of member states to collect and manage relevant data; and (iii) publish and disseminate reports and research papers on key reform themes. the region. In particular, ALECSO will: (i) create a repository of key education indicators, available to a large public through a</narrative>
  </description>
